<title>FRANCE: Bomb kills three, wounds 72 in Algerian market.</title>
<headline>Bomb kills three, wounds 72 in Algerian market.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb killed three people and wounded 72 in an Algerian market in Kolea, southwest of Algiers, on Friday, security forces said.</p>
<p>In a statement on the official news agency APS, the security forces said two other bombs had been found in the same town and defused.</p>
